WEBVTT

00:14:57.454 --> 00:15:01.621
One of my favorite ways to avoid that
mistake is to identify your deal breakers,

00:15:02.204 --> 00:15:05.579
just like you probably have a list of
nonstarters in her romantic partner,

00:15:06.037 --> 00:15:09.496
you can create a similar list for
what's unacceptable in a job,

00:15:09.704 --> 00:15:13.329
a boss or a culture. If you
figure them out up front,

00:15:13.662 --> 00:15:15.162
you can keep yourself honest.

00:15:15.912 --> 00:15:17.829
I've often advised students to do this

00:15:17.829 --> 00:15:20.579
and they report that it helps them
re-evaluate their decisions

00:15:20.746 --> 00:15:25.121
and avoid escalation. But what if the
escalation is bigger than you?

00:15:25.871 --> 00:15:30.621
What if your team, your boss or your
entire company makes a habit of staying